  "englishMetadata": {
    "title": "One game, two looks: Diablo II Resurrected’s graphics toggle",
    "description": "Separating game-state logic from rendering lets the same battle appear in two visual styles. We explain the principle using official gameplay comparisons and our own diagram, based on release-era Diablo II: Resurrected developer accounts. Diagram values are illustrations, not measurements from the game.\n\n🎮 Build games with real programming skills.\n\nYamYamCoding is a Korean game-programming channel covering DirectX, Unity, Unreal Engine and computer graphics.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🚀 Premium 1:1 programming coaching\n\nLearn to design and implement real projects with guided feedback.\nDirectX11 / DirectX12 · Unity / Unreal Engine · Computer Graphics & PBR · Shaders / Rendering · Game engines · Graphics papers and implementation\n\nProgramming coaching\nhttps://www.yamyamcoding.com/1430b1ff-a61e-8040-a542-d672d5d25328\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n💬 YamYamCoding community\n\nQuestions, code reviews, feedback and course materials.\n\nDiscord\nhttps://discord.gg/wZuqe7fqkR\n\nYouTube channel membership\nhttps://www.youtube.com/channel/UCOgtkPoyC0VXhCs7Xk3jvjQ/join\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nSources and credits\nDeveloper account: https://www.well-played.com.au/all-things-diablo-ii-resurrected-blizzcon-insights-from-the-developers-bringing-hell-back-to-life/\nOfficial account: https://news.blizzard.com/en-us/article/23722094/bringing-the-original-diablo-ii-experience-to-console\nGameplay: Blizzard Entertainment official comparison captures\nhttps://diablo2.blizzard.com/en-us/\n\nhttps://www.blizzard.com/en-us/legal/2068564f-f427-4c1c-8664-c107c90b34d5/blizzard-video-policy\n\nProduction tools: Motion Canvas (https://motioncanvas.io/), Qwen3-TTS (https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen3-TTS), FFmpeg (https://ffmpeg.org/).\nOriginal explanatory demonstrations and editing: Yamyam Coding.\n\nMusic\nPixel Peeker Polka - faster Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)\nLicensed under Creative Commons: By Attribution 4.0 License\nhttps://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\nhttps://incompetech.com/music/royalty-free/index.html?isrc=USUAN1100833\nExcerpted, faded and volume-adjusted.",
